<header>
<h1 class="p-name">WHAT IS DIGITAL MARKETING?</h1>
</header>
<section data-field="subtitle" class="p-summary">
Digital marketing sounds very familiar in today’s world. But this concept was started in 1990. Since then, there has been a lot of…
</section>
<section data-field="body" class="e-content">
<section name="4290" class="section section--body section--first"><div class="section-divider"><hr class="section-divider"></div><div class="section-content"><div class="section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn"><h3 name="9c54" id="9c54" class="graf graf--h3 graf--leading graf--title">WHAT IS DIGITAL MARKETING?</h3><figure name="ba01" id="ba01" class="graf graf--figure graf-after--h3"><img class="graf-image" data-image-id="0*0DHSZhokpFeGE-KL.jpg" data-width="1200" data-height="630" data-is-featured="true" src="https://cdn-images-1.medium.com/max/800/0*0DHSZhokpFeGE-KL.jpg"></figure><p name="e5db" id="e5db" class="graf graf--p graf-after--figure">Digital marketing sounds very familiar in today’s world. But this concept was started in 1990. Since then, there has been a lot of development in digital marketing. At first, digital marketing started through search engines like Google, Yahoo. But after the rise of social media, digital marketing reached another level.</p><p name="dbf9" id="dbf9" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">A common misconception is that, digital marketing and e-commerce are the same. There is a slight difference between these two. E-commerce is the way of buying and selling products over the Internet, whereas digital marketing is done for the marketing of products or services using the internet.</p><p name="e167" id="e167" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Digital marketing can be done across numerous platforms. In this article, I’ll be focusing on three major digital marketing platforms.</p><p name="4131" id="4131" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Facebook is one of the platforms where digital marketing through social media was initially started. <strong class="markup--strong markup--p-strong">99%</strong> of the companies use Facebook for digital marketing because it has a vast number of users than any other social media platform.</p><p name="e2e6" id="e2e6" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">It actively provides for this, allowing users to create individual profiles or business pages for companies and organizations.</p><p name="7fd8" id="7fd8" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">In my opinion, YouTube is one of the best platform for digital marketing. It is highly useful for digital marketing through video advertisements. Video ads are less hated than pop-up ads. These videos are often very interesting and the user ends up watching the whole video.</p><p name="a466" id="a466" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">This attracts more consumers than pop-up ads. The popularity of YouTube is growing rapidly. Brands not only push ads in the opening of the video, but also sponsor videos in order to get a wider reach. Almost 8 out of 10 marketers consider YouTube to be the most effective video marketing platform.</p><p name="7199" id="7199" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Apart from social media marketing, search engines like Google, Yahoo, are also great platforms for digital marketing. Every search engine has its own digital marketing strategy.</p><p name="f095" id="f095" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Many search engines use cookies. These cookies are designed to collect user data in order to push relevant and more personalised ads. This is more useful than pushing random ads.</p><p name="1604" id="1604" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p">Digital marketing benefits businesses of all sizes by giving access to the mass market at an affordable price. While you can reach a global audience with digital marketing, you are also up against global competition.</p><p name="d298" id="d298" class="graf graf--p graf-after--p graf--trailing">It can be a challenge to stand out against competitors and to grab attention among the many messages aimed at consumers online.</p></div></div></section><section name="45bd" class="section section--body section--last"><div class="section-divider"><hr class="section-divider"></div><div class="section-content"><div class="section-inner sectionLayout--insetColumn"><p name="8c80" id="8c80" class="graf graf--p graf--leading graf--trailing"><em class="markup--em markup--p-em">Originally published at </em><a href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2020/08/what-is-digital-marketing-technobyte.html" data-href="https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com/2020/08/what-is-digital-marketing-technobyte.html" class="markup--anchor markup--p-anchor" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><em class="markup--em markup--p-em">https://thetechnobyte.blogspot.com</em></a><em class="markup--em markup--p-em"> on August 5, 2020.</em></p></div></div></section>
</section>
